{{/* Only the annotations this wiki writes are printed. Grafana adds its own
     when a rule is edited or a query fails, grafana_state_reason and
     datasource_uid and ref_id so far, and nobody here has use for them.
     Rules that also post to Mastodon keep summary for readers and the
     operator's detail in description. */ -}}
